     C*
     C* RPG/400 reserved words, figurative constants, indicators used
     C* as data, and the literal forms.
     C*
     C* Member: RPGRSV   Compilable: no (calculations only, no files)
     C* Source: RPG/400 Reference SC09-1817, chapter 12 (words with
     C*         special functions) and chapter 1 (literals).
     C* Retrieved: 2026-07-26
     C*
     C*
     C* System date. UDATE and *DATE hold the whole date; the
     C* others hold one part of it.
     C                     Z-ADDUDATE     WRKDAT
     C                     Z-ADDUMONTH    WRKMON
     C                     Z-ADDUDAY      WRKDAY
     C                     Z-ADDUYEAR     WRKYR
     C           *DATE     MOVE           WRKDAT
     C           *MONTH    MOVE           WRKMON
     C           *DAY      MOVE           WRKDAY
     C           *YEAR     MOVE           WRKYR
     C*
     C* Page numbering: PAGE and PAGE1 through PAGE7.
     C                     Z-ADD*ZERO     PAGE
     C                     Z-ADD*ZERO     PAGE1
     C                     Z-ADD*ZERO     PAGE2
     C                     Z-ADD*ZERO     PAGE3
     C                     Z-ADD*ZERO     PAGE4
     C                     Z-ADD*ZERO     PAGE5
     C                     Z-ADD*ZERO     PAGE6
     C                     Z-ADD*ZERO     PAGE7
     C*
     C* Figurative constants are implied literals: no length needed.
     C           *BLANK    MOVE           CHRFLD
     C           *BLANKS   MOVE           CHRFLD
     C                     Z-ADD*ZERO     NUMFLD
     C                     Z-ADD*ZEROS    NUMFLD
     C           *HIVAL    MOVE           KEYFLD
     C           *LOVAL    MOVE           KEYFLD
     C           *ON       MOVE           SWITCH
     C           *OFF      MOVE           SWITCH
     C           *ALL'-'   MOVE           RULE
     C           *ALL'ABC' MOVE           RULE
     C           *ALLX'FF' MOVE           MASK
     C*
     C* Indicators referred to as data. *IN is the array, *IN,xx an
     C* element, and *INxx the one-position field.
     C           *IN       MOVEA          SAVIND
     C           *IN,01    MOVE           SWITCH
     C           *IN01     MOVE           SWITCH
     C           *IN99     MOVE           SWITCH
     C           *INLR     MOVE           SWITCH
     C           *INL1     MOVE           SWITCH
     C           *INH1     MOVE           SWITCH
     C           *INMR     MOVE           SWITCH
     C           *INRT     MOVE           SWITCH
     C           *INU1     MOVE           SWITCH
     C           *INOA     MOVE           SWITCH
     C           *INOV     MOVE           SWITCH
     C           *INKA     MOVE           SWITCH
     C           *IN1P     MOVE           SWITCH
     C*
     C* Symbolic locations in the file information and program
     C* status data structures.
     C           *FILE     MOVE           WRKFIL
     C           *OPCODE   MOVE           WRKOPC
     C                     Z-ADD*PARMS    WRKCNT
     C           *PROGRAM  MOVE           WRKPGM
     C           *RECORD   MOVE           WRKREC
     C           *ROUTINE  MOVE           WRKRTN
     C                     Z-ADD*STATUS   WRKSTS
     C*
     C* Symbolic return points for ENDSR.
     CSR         *PSSR     BEGSR
     C           *CANCL    MOVE           RETPT
     C           *DETC     MOVE           RETPT
     C           *DETL     MOVE           RETPT
     C           *GETIN    MOVE           RETPT
     C           *INIT     MOVE           RETPT
     C           *OFL      MOVE           RETPT
     C           *TERM     MOVE           RETPT
     C           *TOTC     MOVE           RETPT
     C           *TOTL     MOVE           RETPT
     CSR         RETPT     ENDSR
     C*
     C* Special words used with operation codes.
     C           *LIKE     DEFN ORDAMT    WRKAMT
     C           *NAMVAR   DEFN *LDA      LDADS
     C           *NAMVAR   DEFN *PDA      PDADS
     C           *LOCK     IN   LDADS
     C           *ENTRY    PLIST
     CSR         *INZSR    BEGSR
     CSR                   ENDSR
     C           *NOKEY    CLEARCUSTFMT
     C           'GO?'     DSPLY*EXT      ANSWER
     C*
     C* Character, numeric and hexadecimal literals.
     C           'A'       MOVE           CHRFLD
     C           'HELLO'   MOVE           CHRFLD
     C           'IT''S'   MOVE           CHRFLD           Doubled quote
     C           ' '       MOVEL          CHRFLD
     C                     Z-ADD0         NUMFLD
     C                     Z-ADD1234567890NUMFLD
     C                     Z-ADD-42       NUMFLD
     C                     Z-ADD+42       NUMFLD
     C           -99       COMP NUMFLD               30
     C                     Z-ADD3.14159   NUMFLD
     C                     Z-ADD-0.5      NUMFLD
     C           X'FF'     MOVE           MASK
     C           X'0D25'   MOVE           CRLF
     C           x'40'     MOVE           MASK             Lowercase x
     C*
     C* Reserved words are not recognised inside a literal or a
     C* comment: *BLANKS and UDATE below are plain text.
     C           '*BLANKS' MOVE           CHRFLD
     C           'UDATE'   MOVE           CHRFLD           UDATE in a note
